        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Plan Your Visit The venue is located on the southwest corner of Lawrence at Warden Avenue. It is a fully accessible building with an elevator from underground parking and from the ground level to the balcony. The entrance to underground parking is via a lane running behind the building accessed by going south on Warden. [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
